        "slc_702f669c7e601e883de37b0e3bd3a4036cd07a427b6295cd125a24e10a5db376"
      ],
      "text": "The extension manages three knowledge types: MEMORY.md facts (5,000-char cap), USER.md profile (5,000-char cap), and Pi-native SKILL.md procedures with unlimited size."
    },
    {
