        "slc_cfed6609627be9d6d8fd9b8aa334c267d328b92cc46253881e3e23ef26e9fa04"
      ],
      "text": "Memory is stored at two tiers: global facts under ~/.pi/agent/pi-hermes-memory/ and per-project facts under ~/.pi/agent/projects-memory/<project>/, with project memories searchable when the cwd matches."
    },
    {
